  "title": "Cucumber tomato & green onion salad",
  "description": "Adding any other vegetables to this salad is not prohibited!\nUse olive oil instead of sour cream if you don't like sour cream.",
  "editorial": {
    "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Looking for a \"quick\" salad &nbsp;to make? This cucumber and tomato salad is not just fast and easy salad to make, it is also a great summer side dish that goes perfectly with fish, potato, rice, omelet or just by itself. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe {\"id\":21611,\"template\":\"chic-template-english\",\"updated\":1656967680596} -->\n<!--WPRM Recipe 21611-->\n<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe\">\n\t<h2 class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-name\">Cucumber tomato &amp; green onion salad</h2>\n\t<img class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-image\" src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/IMG_9844-2.Blog_-150x150.png\"/>\t<p class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-summary\">\n\t\tAdding any other vegetables to this salad is not prohibited!\r\nUse olive oil instead of sour cream if you don't like sour cream.\t</p>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-equipment\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-ingredients\">\n\t\t<ul><li>1-2 cucumber (sliced)</li><li>5-6 tomatoes (quartered)</li><li>1 clove garlic (pressed)</li><li>Salt and freshly ground black pepper (to taste)</li><li>Some green onions (chopped)</li><li>2 Tbsp sour cream</li></ul>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-instructions\">\n\t\t<ol><li>In the bowl, combine the cucumber, tomatoes, garlic, green onion, salt and pepper. Add the sour cream and gently toss. Serve right away.</li></ol>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-notes\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta-course\">Salads</div>\t</div>\n</div>\n<!--End WPRM Recipe-->\n<!-- /wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe -->",
    "excerpt": null
  },
